# Contact form delivery (Formspree)
#
# 1. Create a free form at https://formspree.io/ and set its recipient to
#    darshsoam2006@gmail.com
# 2. Copy the form ID from the endpoint Formspree gives you:
#      https://formspree.io/f/xyzabcde   ->  xyzabcde
# 3. Copy this file to `.env` and paste the ID below.
#
# Without this value the contact form shows an honest error and points
# visitors at the mailto: link instead of pretending the send succeeded.
VITE_FORMSPREE_FORM_ID=
